almost like a, an internet chat room where
there's no leaders, there are no spokespersons,

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:23.380
there are no programs, certainly no ideologies,
but they're very anti ideology. So as you

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:30.119
can tell, I am not a young person when I was
