00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:53.140
one to take hold.

00:01:53.140 --> 00:02:01.700
Yeah. I think, uh, it's a coalition between
information enabled by technology and systems

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:06.009
of, and it's not just government. I think
you could say the same about every major institution

00:02:06.009 --> 00:02:14.200
that that modern society, uh, uh, is sustained
