ways of uh, parsing information and data.

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:17.650
Um, and if you want to mobilize at unify,
there's very fractured environment. The only

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:25.100
way to do so is by being against, and there
is this tremendous swelling of um, anger against,

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:30.040
uh, the established order. So what, what you
have in many of these four bolts, and you

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:35.330
can start with Tahrir square in Egypt and
