00:05:56.750 --> 00:06:02.050
own sake is a form of progress. And I mean,
I leave you to consider that. I don't think

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:03.050
it is.

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:06.389
Well, that seems to be one of the big divisions
